SUMMARY:Breakthrough Circle
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**What if the answers you'
 ve been searching for could appear right before your eyes — not as words
 \, but as images that speak directly to your soul?**\n\n**I'm launching so
 mething new\, and I'd love for you to be part of it.**\n**I'm hosting a co
 mplimentary gathering called Breakthrough Circle: Live Intuitive Wisdom Dr
 awings. This is your chance to experience the transformative power of this
  work in a group setting — no cost\, no pressure\, just pure possibility
 .**\n\n**Here's how it works:**\n**During this 60-minute online session\, 
 I'll create 3-4 live Intuitive Wisdom Drawings for randomly selected parti
 cipants. As the images unfold from scribbles to revelations\, everyone in 
 the circle gets to witness the breakthrough process in real-time.**\n\n**Y
 ou might be thinking: "But what if I'm not one of the people selected?"**\
 n\n**Here's the beautiful truth: even as an observer\, you'll gain profoun
 d insights. The wisdom that emerges is often universal\, speaking to chall
 enges and dreams we all share. You'll walk away with tools\, clarity\, and
  a deeper connection to your own inner knowing.**\n\n**What to expect:**\n
 \n* **Journey from scribble to soul-deep revelation**\n* **Watch hidden ob
 stacles and solutions surface through intuitive imagery**\n* **Tap into co
 llective wisdom as we explore each drawing**\n* **Gain practical tools you
  can apply immediately**\n* **Connect with a supportive community**\n\n**Y
 our soul is smarter than any coach. I do the drawings\, you have the break
 throughs.**\n**Join us Wed\, July 22nd @3:00 PM**\n**REGISTER HERE (No rep
 lay)**\n**[https://MAOL.as.me/breakthrough](https://maol.as.me/breakthroug
 h)**\n\n**Space is intentionally limited to keep the experience intimate\,
  so claim your spot today.**\n**I can't wait to create this experience wit
 h you.**\n\n**Never experienced an Intuitive Wisdom Drawing? This is the p
 erfect introduction.**\n\n**Come with curiosity and an open heart—that's
  all you need.**
